WEBVTT

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:19.840
2 years later. Second year of Hyejong's reign

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:25.130
After this, change the herbs in the water

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.400
Girls, the eldest is coming!

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:47.290
Project coordinator and song translator: Nemie

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:57.390
Translators: Nemie, Kaia, tamaramin

00:00:56.650 --> 00:00:58.650
Episode 14

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:58.600
Madam!

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:07.490
Beta editor and typesetter: Nemie

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:00.870
I asked you not to call me that

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:03.440
It's become a habit, I can't help it

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:07.310
Besides, “court lady He”... this is unusual

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:11.230
Are these words?

00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:12.590
Yes, words

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:15.400
You must learn to read and write too

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:18.300
How can I? At that age...

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:20.490
I memorized all the teas in the pantry and medicinal herbs,

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:22.370
that's quite enough

00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:26.530
Happy Birthday

00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:30.390
Today is your birthday, madam

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:33.540
I'm giving this to you because your knee still hurts.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.570
Very beautiful

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:39.050
Thank you

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:42.170
I will use it to prevent my knee from hurting

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:47.850
But the best gift is to see you in Damiwon

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:52.570
All because Prince Wook, with your help, freed me

00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:58.530
Happy Birthday

00:01:59.170 --> 00:02:01.960
I saw it in Bökrando and immediately realized that it was perfect for you

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:07.850
Delivered by a Persian merchant

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:09.950
From Bulgaria

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:14.950
Rose scent

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:18.230
This oil is made from peeled rose leaves

00:02:18.230 --> 00:02:20.380
Ideal for incense bags

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:21.850
I liked it

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:27.270
Brother didn't know what to choose, so he wandered around

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:29.870
and ended up returning with nothing

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:33.560
Just a court lady's birthday. The fact that the princes are here is already a gift

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:35.940
- What else do you want?
- Yes, it's true

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:39.820
I'm just a court lady who should be happy that she was born

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:22.940
Were you the one making the animal noises?

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:24.000
Yes

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:29.270
They were too believable, I was afraid you wouldn’t know it was me

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:33.930
You are neither a dog nor a wolf

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:36.130
Sounded like you were choking on a rice cake

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:40.090
What's the difference? You came anyway

00:03:57.030 --> 00:03:59.190
- Let's go
- What?

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:13.550
I'll show you something nice as a gift

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.510
Let's go, I say

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:30.720
I'm telling you it's a fixed star

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:33.820
Oh, and this is an anchor

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:37.830
You're talking about the North Star

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:40.600
This is not an anchor, this is Cassiopeia

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:45.330
Forgot how good I am at astronomy?

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:50.120
I want to say that you learned the wrong things

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:55.170
Do you see Cassiopeia?

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:57.920
Queen Cassiopeia of Ethiopia boasted,

00:04:57.920 --> 00:05:01.090
that her daughter is more beautiful than the sea fairy

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:03.640
They say she was punished by the sea gods

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:05.670
Look at this

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:08.780
Doesn't it look like an overturned chair?

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:11.100
No need to be proud

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:14.820
They say that as punishment she hung upside down in the sky for half a day.

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:35.200
A long time ago, when I was younger

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:38.890
I went to see my mother, whom I had not seen for a long time.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:45.450
She had Jeong on her lap,

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:47.140
she told him stories

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:51.530
I wished to myself for Jeong to disappear

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:56.440
I wanted to take his place

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:04.270
Mother saw the expression on my face and quickly hid Jeong

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:10.070
Maybe she already knew that I
capable of killing his brother?

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:17.970
People who have younger ones
brothers and sisters always say that

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:20.900
Me too

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:23.360
"It would be nice if he left"

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:26.090
"Why does this person have to be around and upset me?"

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:33.320
You want to make me give up on you

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:35.980
or do you want him to always look only at you?

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:38.600
What?

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:44.110
No matter how I come to you, you always solve my problems

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:47.310
How can I live without seeing you?

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:58.120
If you don't come to me, don't give me hope

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:04.150
For me... it's torture

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:16.820
You said you needed permission?

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:20.150
- Can?
- You can't

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:30.130
We didn’t, but we were going to, right?

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:31.360
I won't

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:35.280
In that case, the emperor will make you his second wife.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:37.250
old powerful man

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:39.550
This will never happen

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:41.660
The Emperor favors me

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:44.220
What kind of boasting

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.690
Do you have a day off in a few days?

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:05.300
Let's go together to the prayer tower

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:09.150
To the prayer tower?

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:11.150
I want to tell you something

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:14.840
I think I'll do it there

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:20.610
You'll come, won't you?

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:42.750
The Emperor wants to overhaul the palace's armed forces

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:47.770
This means that all the soldiers of powerful clans will join the palace army

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:50.140
They will take turns providing support.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:00.860
His Majesty's illness is getting worse day by day

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:03.490
You know he has a hard time attending morning meetings

00:09:04.340 --> 00:09:08.950
This was the will of the emperor, so we should not hesitate in this matter.

00:09:18.690 --> 00:09:21.390
Uk

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:25.060
You go over the line too often

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:29.430
Using the emperor's illness as an excuse, you act like a regent

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:32.470
It didn't happen anyway because of your objection.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:34.640
I'll be careful not to get the wrong idea

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:37.670
The fact that you behave like an official

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:39.880
has already caused discontent among the clans

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:44.180
If you continue to put pressure on them, hiding behind the emperor,

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:46.680
their resentment will grow

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:50.220
Are you laughing?

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:52.490
I thought you were only good at fighting

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:54.890
And now you understand politics too

00:09:54.890 --> 00:09:56.890
I can't compare to you

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:03.530
I still have doubts about you

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:06.740
I was just trying to fill the emperor's absence, but I overdid it.

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:09.340
I'll take your advice

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:15.210
This is not something that a simple official can do

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:33.190
Hyejeong

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:31.980
After taking a bath

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:35.010
I feel tired

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:39.480
When I wake up

00:10:39.480 --> 00:10:42.500
I don't know if it was yesterday or today

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:44.680
Memory has become blurry

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:48.170
The doctor said you need more sleep

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:51.190
I will make tea for you and change your sleeping pillow

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:56.740
I'm leaving Chae Ryung with you,
take longer baths

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:21.950
Did you add more herbs?

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:24.800
The smell is so strong

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:26.390
Y-yes, Your Majesty

00:11:27.610 --> 00:11:29.320
I thought I'd dilute it...

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:55.080
Ah,

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:57.480
I heard that Damiwon requires a large amount of mercury to produce the mirror,

00:11:57.480 --> 00:12:01.150
so I sent it

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:04.220
Has she arrived successfully?

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:08.220
Yes, your highness

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:11.690
I've already checked everything

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:32.260
Ugh, something strange is happening

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.450
I can't sleep at all

00:12:35.990 --> 00:12:39.880
When I fall asleep I have nightmares

00:12:43.250 --> 00:12:45.120
The sun is hot in summer

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:48.640
So why am I cold?

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:51.470
Your Majesty

00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:57.620
I think the time has come

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:05.150
Why don't you hand over the throne to me?

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:08.920
What?

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:12.910
I know that you instructed Choi Chi Mon to spread false rumors.

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:15.440
about being the son of a dragon

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:23.050
Due to severe rashes on your skin, scaly scars have formed

00:13:23.050 --> 00:13:26.200
Uk... Uk, you

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:28.170
If you give me the throne,

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:33.180
I will provide you with a comfortable life

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:36.670
The throne is a burden

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:42.730
Don't you think it's time to get rid of this burden for the sake of others?

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:45.750
Brother

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:06.460
Come on princess, don't be afraid

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:10.680
Hurry up and go!

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:13.540
You must go in order to survive! And for the good of the country!

00:14:19.390 --> 00:14:22.650
Your Majesty, I don't want to get married!

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:26.480
Stupid child! This is all to save you!

00:14:26.480 --> 00:14:30.000
Go faster! Go!

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.780
Go! Faster!

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:36.960
Your Majesty. The princess is still so small, how can you send her to the Khitans?

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:38.820
This is wrong

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:42.860
If she gets married they'll send troops when I'm in danger

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:50.930
Did you hear that?

00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:53.350
I'm sure I heard the horses trampling

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:57.350
Go! Here you can die at any moment! Quicker!

00:14:57.350 --> 00:15:00.050
Your Majesty! Father!

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:02.250
Mother! Mother!

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:09.240
Mother! Mother!

00:15:09.240 --> 00:15:13.810
Mother! Mother!

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:15.940
Mother!

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:17.260
Father!

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:19.100
You must go!

00:15:21.050 --> 00:15:24.740
- Hurry up and go! Go!
- Father!

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:28.240
Go quickly!

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:30.170
Father!

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:33.970
Stop!

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:37.100
Khitani?

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:41.390
If you send her there, she'll just be a hostage.

00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:43.710
You must understand this!

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:45.200
What do you know?!

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:48.470
Every night I'm afraid that they will kill me,

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:50.210
I can’t close my eyes at all

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:53.820
People I trusted are asking me to renounce!

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:56.850
They ask to give up the throne

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:00.020
In the end I will die like this

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:03.860
We will all die. Who will protect us?

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:07.330
Your Majesty

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:12.040
Can you do it?

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:19.260
Will you marry the princess and protect us?

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:46.430
Will you hear him?

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:51.980
The same voice that is in such a hurry to confess

00:16:53.430 --> 00:16:55.880
Are you still listening?

00:16:55.880 --> 00:17:00.030
Can you hear my heart?

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:06.150
How raindrops settled on the window

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:12.600
Also my mind is consumed by you

00:17:13.350 --> 00:17:14.800
Need you

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:17.480
Need you

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:20.750
I miss you

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:39.940
Have you come?

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:45.940
oh my god

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:48.870
I didn’t even think that you would come, I wasn’t even in a hurry

00:17:49.470 --> 00:17:50.700
How long did you wait?

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:56.230
You wanted to tell me something important

00:17:56.230 --> 00:17:57.420
Something important?

00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:01.840
Oh, exactly. I told you so

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:03.580
So what did I want?

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:04.790
What?

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:08.000
I can't even remember

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:12.110
What is this? What's happened?

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:15.000
Why are you asking me?

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:23.260
You asked to come here, you wanted to say something important

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:31.710
What? So you were hoping that this was something significant?

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:35.850
Now I feel guilty

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:37.780
No

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:39.880
Really?

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:45.100
I still feel guilty
so let's do something different

00:18:45.630 --> 00:18:48.630
Will you hear him?

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:54.180
The same voice that is in such a hurry to confess

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:58.080
Are you still listening?

00:18:58.080 --> 00:19:02.230
Can you hear my heart?

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:08.350
How raindrops settled on the window

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:14.800
Also my mind is consumed by you

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:17.000
Need you

00:19:18.100 --> 00:19:19.680
Need you

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:22.950
I miss you

00:19:23.440 --> 00:19:25.350
Can you move faster?

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:28.750
I want to feel the wind

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:31.420
Do you want to row?

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:37.490
I've always been interested

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:39.770
Is this your boat?

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:44.770
I brought her to the palace as a child, when I first came here.

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:48.480
I didn't care what others thought

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:49.910
when I swam on it

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:54.510
This is my favorite thing in the palace

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:59.760
It’s strange that my favorite one, I didn’t see you on it

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:07.020
I really like her

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:13.700
If I did what I liked, I wouldn't want to leave the palace

00:20:15.180 --> 00:20:16.480
I didn’t swim on it on purpose

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:22.270
Why are you looking like that?

00:20:24.060 --> 00:20:28.960
I thought about what it would be like -
turn away from what you like

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:36.200
It's good that you don't have to look away anymore

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:45.570
I'm sorry

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:48.260
For what?

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:50.240
For words

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:54.510
For forgetting important words

00:20:54.510 --> 00:20:56.410
I'm sure you'll remember soon

00:20:58.740 --> 00:21:00.990
You don't have to rush

00:21:24.910 --> 00:21:26.700
You've made a big decision

00:21:28.910 --> 00:21:30.990
If I marry a princess,

00:21:30.990 --> 00:21:33.510
Empress Yu and family from Shinzhu

00:21:33.510 --> 00:21:36.570
They'll mistakenly think I'm aiming for the throne

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:39.990
I will be able to control other clans

00:21:40.850 --> 00:21:43.050
Attacks on the Emperor will stop

00:21:44.310 --> 00:21:45.980
You've already calculated everything

00:21:45.980 --> 00:21:48.630
Your political skills have improved significantly

00:21:49.710 --> 00:21:51.760
There's one thing I can't resolve

00:21:53.550 --> 00:21:58.360
Will I go back to being a dog on a leash protecting my brother?

00:22:00.200 --> 00:22:02.050
Is this my destiny?

00:22:04.950 --> 00:22:09.470
I'm tired of turning my back on the things I like

00:22:09.980 --> 00:22:11.170
Everything always goes down the drain

00:22:15.010 --> 00:22:16.100
Tell me

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:20.210
How can I take off this leash and be free?

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:27.350
Most dogs bite their owners and take all the goodness into their paws.

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:30.190
Do you want to start a riot?

00:22:31.890 --> 00:22:32.950
Of course not

00:22:36.950 --> 00:22:39.220
Thank you for protecting the emperor

00:22:43.520 --> 00:22:46.000
He won't stick with you for long

00:23:00.780 --> 00:23:03.390
This is a proclamation from Wang Hu

00:23:14.470 --> 00:23:17.440
“I sent this petition to the past king twice.”

00:23:17.440 --> 00:23:21.730
"I believe that Prince Seo will be expelled from the palace."

00:23:22.350 --> 00:23:26.270
“His elder brother Ye has already betrayed you, Your Majesty.”

00:23:26.270 --> 00:23:27.380
You can stop

00:23:28.390 --> 00:23:30.660
The point of this message is

00:23:33.270 --> 00:23:35.830
so that I renounce the throne in your favor, Uk

00:23:37.830 --> 00:23:39.990
So I shouldn't listen any further

00:23:45.610 --> 00:23:50.000
You must have misinterpreted my behavior, Your Majesty.

00:23:50.850 --> 00:23:54.030
I just want to ease your burden in any way I can.

00:23:54.030 --> 00:23:56.110
I told you this out of loyalty

00:23:57.630 --> 00:23:59.000
Does this make you angry?

00:23:59.590 --> 00:24:00.660
No

00:24:02.630 --> 00:24:04.410
Just like you said

00:24:04.410 --> 00:24:07.350
I plan to share my burden with my brother

00:24:08.970 --> 00:24:12.330
Emperor, His Highness the 4th Prince wishes to see you

00:24:12.330 --> 00:24:14.070
Tell him to come in

00:24:20.810 --> 00:24:22.330
Greetings, Your Majesty

00:24:22.840 --> 00:24:23.910
Yes,

00:24:24.580 --> 00:24:28.400
So is going to marry my eldest daughter

00:24:31.020 --> 00:24:31.940
What?

00:24:31.940 --> 00:24:36.620
However, the princess is still too young and not ready to start a family

00:24:36.620 --> 00:24:39.310
I don't mind her being a second wife

00:24:44.820 --> 00:24:47.760
Astronomer Chi Mon chooses wedding day

00:25:00.840 --> 00:25:02.760
Uk, I took your advice

00:25:04.330 --> 00:25:06.580
I plan to pass the throne to So

00:25:09.600 --> 00:25:12.080
He is my brother and brother-in-law

00:25:13.010 --> 00:25:15.430
Who might be a more suitable candidate?

00:25:18.250 --> 00:25:19.450
Isn't that right?

00:25:21.860 --> 00:25:23.350
Of course, Your Majesty

00:25:28.490 --> 00:25:31.030
Congratulations on your marriage

00:25:35.490 --> 00:25:39.390
I hope there are no girls crying over the loss of such a wonderful man.

00:25:40.160 --> 00:25:41.630
Do you agree, Emperor?

00:25:56.020 --> 00:26:00.100
Hey, you said you'd put makeup on me
so why just stand there and watch?

00:26:00.640 --> 00:26:04.910
First you need to cleanse your skin

00:26:18.110 --> 00:26:19.440
Smells like roses

00:26:19.440 --> 00:26:22.930
You didn’t use the oil from Bulgaria that I gave you?!

00:26:22.930 --> 00:26:25.600
My experience has been questioned, so why keep it?

00:26:26.100 --> 00:26:30.100
I poured a lot, the skin will be very soft

00:26:30.100 --> 00:26:32.420
He swings a sword every day, so rude

00:26:32.420 --> 00:26:34.020
Why spend so much money on it?

00:26:34.020 --> 00:26:36.210
- Brother!
- Don't move

00:26:38.190 --> 00:26:40.620
You can't move for two hours

00:26:41.330 --> 00:26:42.890
Madam!

00:26:43.310 --> 00:26:45.670
His Highness will like it

00:26:47.150 --> 00:26:50.140
Oh your skin is so much lighter

00:26:50.140 --> 00:26:52.240
Just like Hae Soo said, my skin is much clearer now

00:26:52.240 --> 00:26:54.570
Really? Are all the spots gone?

00:26:54.570 --> 00:26:59.410
Yes. Now the face is bright and shiny, looks very good

00:26:59.410 --> 00:27:03.210
Your face used to be dark
but now it has become so lively

00:27:03.210 --> 00:27:04.870
Elastic

00:27:06.740 --> 00:27:08.630
What a picture

00:27:08.630 --> 00:27:11.430
Shiny, light...

00:27:12.120 --> 00:27:15.620
What words? What a disgusting thing

00:27:15.660 --> 00:27:17.250
Brother, you misunderstood

00:27:17.250 --> 00:27:19.910
I was worried that you didn't understand my attitude towards Hae Soo

00:27:19.910 --> 00:27:21.720
Now you're seducing my brother?

00:27:23.070 --> 00:27:25.580
Hae Soo is not like that

00:27:25.580 --> 00:27:26.890
Enough already!

00:27:27.980 --> 00:27:31.640
Sometimes you go too far

00:27:36.900 --> 00:27:38.850
What a terrible character?

00:27:38.850 --> 00:27:42.750
Why bring Hae Soo into this?
if you envy our good relationship?

00:27:42.750 --> 00:27:44.750
Put people in an awkward position

00:27:48.080 --> 00:27:50.920
You, prince, do not know your own feelings

00:27:50.920 --> 00:27:53.420
You are interested in your wife, although you say the opposite

00:27:53.420 --> 00:27:55.420
Why do you look so exhausted?

00:27:55.750 --> 00:27:56.930
Forget it!

00:27:57.930 --> 00:28:00.530
The most useless life in the world is marriage, marriage!

00:28:01.240 --> 00:28:03.020
Jeong, it's better to live alone

00:28:03.960 --> 00:28:06.600
So should forget about it while he still can.

00:28:07.540 --> 00:28:09.250
Is Brother Seo getting married?

00:28:09.250 --> 00:28:10.600
You didn't know?

00:28:11.060 --> 00:28:14.380
The brother will become the emperor's son-in-law

00:28:15.480 --> 00:28:17.600
I heard the wedding is coming soon

00:28:37.290 --> 00:28:38.460
Are you aware

00:28:40.910 --> 00:28:44.240
You can hate me and be offended

00:28:45.770 --> 00:28:47.070
It's all my fault

00:28:48.700 --> 00:28:52.080
Why should I hate you and be offended?

00:28:54.180 --> 00:28:56.700
You didn't promise me anything

00:28:57.380 --> 00:28:59.600
I told you I would get you out of the palace

00:29:01.290 --> 00:29:03.350
Said I want to see you free

00:29:04.790 --> 00:29:07.190
All my words were promises

00:29:09.620 --> 00:29:11.340
But in the end I couldn't keep my promises

00:29:12.380 --> 00:29:14.350
You don't even want to explain yourself?

00:29:15.600 --> 00:29:19.440
I created the problem and you suffered because of it

00:29:20.610 --> 00:29:23.080
I wouldn't give any reason...

00:29:23.080 --> 00:29:25.450
It won't change the fact that I betrayed your trust

00:29:28.030 --> 00:29:29.770
I don't want to waste time on empty talk

00:29:33.190 --> 00:29:34.590
I understand

00:29:37.010 --> 00:29:38.640
I won't ask any more questions

00:29:42.660 --> 00:29:44.100
Congratulations

00:29:46.280 --> 00:29:47.740
with your marriage

00:30:18.400 --> 00:30:19.930
Soo, this is Baek Ah

00:30:20.930 --> 00:30:22.100
I'm coming in

00:30:25.150 --> 00:30:26.730
Hello

00:30:29.040 --> 00:30:30.200
How are you feeling?

00:30:30.820 --> 00:30:32.830
Good as always

00:30:34.590 --> 00:30:39.480
So wanted me to give you this letter

00:30:40.860 --> 00:30:42.910
He said you can take into account these explanations of his

00:30:52.030 --> 00:30:54.970
“Sometimes I’d reach the very sources of the stream”

00:30:55.910 --> 00:30:57.800
"Squatting down, I contemplate how the clouds rise in the distance"

00:30:58.490 --> 00:31:01.860
This is Wang Wei's poem "House in the Zhongnan Mountains"

00:31:03.880 --> 00:31:07.560
I had no idea he wrote so well

00:31:05.630 --> 00:31:09.730
I'm still looking at you from the outside

00:31:10.300 --> 00:31:12.830
There's still so much I don't know about him

00:31:12.850 --> 00:31:20.000
It seemed to me that you are my love

00:31:14.350 --> 00:31:16.770
It was a mistake to think that I knew everything

00:31:17.710 --> 00:31:18.870
How stupid of me

00:31:20.330 --> 00:31:24.730
I kept thinking that you feel the same way

00:31:20.450 --> 00:31:24.730
When he said he wanted to leave the palace with you, he was sincere.

00:31:25.580 --> 00:31:30.450
Although you look the other way

00:31:25.930 --> 00:31:27.700
I know that for sure

00:31:31.700 --> 00:31:39.980
Like the wind, like dust

00:31:40.130 --> 00:31:45.730
I can't catch you and see you

00:31:45.430 --> 00:31:48.370
It happened that I would reach the very sources of the stream

00:31:46.230 --> 00:31:54.380
Do you remember: I love, I love

00:31:48.420 --> 00:31:50.360
Sitting down, I contemplate how the clouds rise in the distance

00:31:52.390 --> 00:31:55.000
It happened that I would reach the very sources of the stream

00:31:54.380 --> 00:32:00.650
I believe there was love, I’ll call it fate

00:31:56.510 --> 00:31:57.930
Sitting down, I contemplate how the clouds rise in the distance

00:32:00.850 --> 00:32:08.730
Do you remember: I love, I love

00:32:02.490 --> 00:32:04.420
It was hard to travel as an ambassador

00:32:05.020 --> 00:32:07.260
But there was also free time

00:32:07.560 --> 00:32:09.560
Every minute I thought about you

00:32:08.950 --> 00:32:15.450
In your eyes, I settled in your gaze

00:32:09.860 --> 00:32:14.330
I want to live peacefully with you, and so that no one will touch us

00:32:14.740 --> 00:32:16.730
If this doesn't happen...

00:32:15.450 --> 00:32:21.830
And I can only answer you:

00:32:16.730 --> 00:32:21.450
I don't care who I will be -
the emperor or someone else

00:32:22.630 --> 00:32:29.130
Hold me if I'm swinging

00:32:29.700 --> 00:32:37.850
Do you remember, I love, I love

00:32:37.850 --> 00:32:44.120
I believe there was love, I’ll call it fate

00:32:38.920 --> 00:32:41.630
It happened that I would reach the very sources of the stream

00:32:42.830 --> 00:32:45.770
Sitting down, I contemplate how the clouds rise in the distance

00:32:44.320 --> 00:32:52.200
Do you remember: I love, I love

00:32:47.140 --> 00:32:49.790
Sometimes I would reach the very sources of the stream.
Sitting down, I contemplate how the clouds rise in the distance

00:32:52.420 --> 00:32:58.920
In your eyes, I settled in your gaze

00:32:52.640 --> 00:32:55.290
It happened that I would reach the very sources of the stream

00:32:56.380 --> 00:32:58.000
Sitting down, I contemplate how the clouds rise in the distance

00:32:58.920 --> 00:33:05.300
And I can only answer you

00:33:05.630 --> 00:33:08.750
my love

00:33:13.950 --> 00:33:15.430
Is my mother inside?

00:33:15.430 --> 00:33:18.700
Her Majesty ordered no one to enter while she was praying.

00:33:19.250 --> 00:33:20.450
It's okay

00:33:20.450 --> 00:33:22.750
I was worried because she had been gone for several days.

00:33:24.770 --> 00:33:26.990
Sorry, Your Highness...

00:33:53.000 --> 00:33:57.200
You say you're a general, but you're not very courageous

00:34:00.050 --> 00:34:01.670
What's going on?

00:34:06.060 --> 00:34:07.860
I was going to tell you

00:34:07.860 --> 00:34:09.310
Don't worry

00:34:11.630 --> 00:34:13.930
Your brother remained alive by the will of heaven

00:34:14.810 --> 00:34:17.540
Heaven is on your mother's side, Jeong

00:34:17.540 --> 00:34:20.530
Then why have you been pretending to be dead all this time?!

00:34:21.410 --> 00:34:25.640
They called me a traitor.
I couldn't show myself to anyone

00:34:28.290 --> 00:34:30.010
I barely managed to stay alive

00:34:31.050 --> 00:34:35.930
If Uncle Wang Sik Ryom
didn't take care of me, I wouldn't have survived

00:34:36.890 --> 00:34:39.710
I will ask the Emperor to acquit you and reinstate you in your title.

00:34:39.710 --> 00:34:43.200
I worked hard for him, he is a caring person

00:34:43.200 --> 00:34:44.910
I'm sure he'll listen

00:34:47.890 --> 00:34:49.220
Reinstate the title?

00:34:53.760 --> 00:34:55.940
I was the one who wanted to take the throne

00:34:56.810 --> 00:34:59.440
He'll kill me as soon as he finds out I'm alive

00:35:00.560 --> 00:35:04.850
By the way, did you hear that Seo is marrying the princess?

00:35:06.640 --> 00:35:10.310
It looks like the Emperor is about to hand over the throne to So

00:35:13.390 --> 00:35:17.030
I am against So sitting on the throne

00:35:17.710 --> 00:35:22.530
However, I cannot support you in the fight against the emperor

00:35:23.530 --> 00:35:25.970
One betrayal is more than enough

00:35:25.970 --> 00:35:28.120
What nonsense are you saying?

00:35:29.350 --> 00:35:31.850
A successful cheating plan is not cheating at all.

00:35:32.840 --> 00:35:35.580
I will take this throne. I...

00:35:37.110 --> 00:35:40.810
I can lose once, but never twice

00:35:42.290 --> 00:35:44.360
I am a loyal subject of the emperor

00:35:45.060 --> 00:35:47.700
You may be my brother, but I will not remain idle

00:35:47.700 --> 00:35:50.160
The Emperor has completely lost his mind!

00:35:51.910 --> 00:35:54.740
He said he killed a mercenary in his chambers

00:35:54.740 --> 00:35:55.840
The truth is

00:35:56.390 --> 00:35:58.640
that because of hallucinations he killed a court lady

00:35:58.640 --> 00:35:59.960
Such a person

00:36:00.720 --> 00:36:04.130
or anyone else he chooses...

00:36:06.120 --> 00:36:08.790
Do you want Goryeo in their hands?

00:36:10.430 --> 00:36:11.430
Is this what you want?

00:36:12.780 --> 00:36:15.240
The Emperor forbade entering and leaving the palace at night

00:36:15.240 --> 00:36:18.950
It doesn't matter who breaks the ban. You have to catch everyone

00:36:38.660 --> 00:36:40.790
I think he went to Damiwon

00:36:51.070 --> 00:36:53.400
He couldn't hide anywhere except these chambers

00:36:54.840 --> 00:36:56.050
Should we break down the door?

00:37:08.970 --> 00:37:10.520
What's going on here?

00:37:11.850 --> 00:37:14.540
Damiwon is not a place you can just break into

00:37:15.420 --> 00:37:16.770
Please go away

00:37:16.770 --> 00:37:19.840
The man who jumped over the palace wall was seen entering here

00:37:19.840 --> 00:37:21.400
We must search your chambers

00:37:21.400 --> 00:37:24.120
I was reading a book and didn't see anyone

00:37:24.920 --> 00:37:26.850
Please look elsewhere

00:37:31.000 --> 00:37:32.460
Where are you going?

00:37:33.870 --> 00:37:36.020
I am the eldest court lady of Damiwon

00:37:36.020 --> 00:37:38.190
I serve directly the emperor

00:37:39.780 --> 00:37:42.350
and I can’t let everyone into my chambers

00:37:42.350 --> 00:37:45.380
Go away, I'll check it personally

00:37:52.220 --> 00:37:53.430
I don't want

00:37:55.510 --> 00:37:57.610
These are the chambers of an unmarried girl

00:37:58.380 --> 00:38:02.200
I'd rather die than disgrace myself

00:38:05.420 --> 00:38:09.310
If you insist on checking,
get the emperor's permission first

00:38:11.070 --> 00:38:12.800
There will be no exceptions for anyone

00:38:16.280 --> 00:38:19.720
Are you sure there is no one in your room?

00:38:19.720 --> 00:38:20.770
Yes

00:38:21.920 --> 00:38:23.420
I'm sure

00:38:36.780 --> 00:38:38.240
We'll look elsewhere

00:38:38.240 --> 00:38:39.260
Yes

00:38:43.390 --> 00:38:44.530
Let's go

00:39:01.800 --> 00:39:02.830
Su!

00:39:03.920 --> 00:39:05.680
They might still be here

00:39:18.130 --> 00:39:19.160
Let me see

00:39:21.130 --> 00:39:22.600
There's a scratch on your neck

00:39:25.820 --> 00:39:27.790
Did you cut yourself?

00:39:28.580 --> 00:39:31.470
They insisted on checking, what could I do?

00:39:31.470 --> 00:39:33.270
Why do you always take such measures?

00:39:33.270 --> 00:39:35.430
You could just let me get caught

00:39:35.430 --> 00:39:37.850
Why say such things?

00:39:38.270 --> 00:39:40.440
You have become even more distant from the 4th prince,

00:39:40.440 --> 00:39:42.230
you better not quarrel with him

00:39:43.780 --> 00:39:45.640
Would you do this even if it wasn't me?

00:39:45.640 --> 00:39:46.660
What?

00:39:48.090 --> 00:39:52.450
If it were another brother, you would help him too

00:39:52.450 --> 00:39:53.470
Right?

00:39:54.670 --> 00:39:56.210
Yes, of course

00:40:05.730 --> 00:40:10.180
If we really fall out and start fighting,

00:40:12.600 --> 00:40:14.250
whose side will you be on?

00:40:16.370 --> 00:40:18.460
Why should I take sides?

00:40:20.080 --> 00:40:22.270
Maybe I'll be the judge

00:40:25.150 --> 00:40:27.050
Now you can’t even imagine that you can go back to those days

00:40:27.050 --> 00:40:28.960
when we were walking in the 8th brother's house

00:40:29.640 --> 00:40:30.770
It's all greed

00:40:32.420 --> 00:40:34.130
We have changed

00:40:34.130 --> 00:40:36.580
Soon you'll have to make a choice

00:40:39.560 --> 00:40:41.210
It's already late

00:40:42.250 --> 00:40:45.970
Get some sleep and then
when it gets quiet, leave immediately

00:40:52.220 --> 00:40:53.660
And yet...

00:40:53.830 --> 00:40:57.210
I will become the darkness

00:40:55.450 --> 00:40:58.530
I don't think I can take sides

00:40:57.470 --> 00:41:01.010
And I'll wrap you in myself

00:41:01.130 --> 00:41:04.760
Just for a day, just like that

00:41:02.080 --> 00:41:04.300
I don't want any of you to get hurt

00:41:05.260 --> 00:41:08.730
Stay with me

00:41:06.240 --> 00:41:08.130
I want to make sure no one dies

00:41:09.230 --> 00:41:12.460
And I will become the moon

00:41:12.810 --> 00:41:16.360
I will be the light for one

00:41:17.210 --> 00:41:22.630
Wherever I am, wherever I go, I will come

00:41:23.930 --> 00:41:27.880
You are my love, believe me

00:41:28.260 --> 00:41:32.160
You're the only one I need so much

00:41:32.160 --> 00:41:35.880
I look at you from afar

00:41:36.130 --> 00:41:39.330
And I'll turn away again

00:41:39.430 --> 00:41:44.060
Here I confess to you alone

00:41:44.060 --> 00:41:47.960
With all my strength I

00:41:47.960 --> 00:41:51.180
Love, love, love

00:41:51.180 --> 00:41:55.600
Can you hear my heart?

00:42:25.510 --> 00:42:28.520
Jeong was in your chambers last night, right?

00:42:30.200 --> 00:42:31.710
Nothing like that

00:42:32.010 --> 00:42:35.160
I've been thinking all night about
to knock down the door. Do you know about this?

00:42:36.100 --> 00:42:38.590
Tell me the truth. Was it Jeong?

00:42:39.970 --> 00:42:41.970
Explain yourself

00:42:42.620 --> 00:42:44.160
Why did you hide Jeong?

00:42:45.760 --> 00:42:48.350
Why don't you explain yourself first, Your Highness?

00:42:49.780 --> 00:42:54.740
Not a poem, but an explanation that I can understand

00:42:56.650 --> 00:42:58.690
Why did you suddenly decide to get married?

00:42:59.530 --> 00:43:03.060
Is what people say true?

00:43:04.150 --> 00:43:06.350
Are you greedy for the throne?

00:43:12.980 --> 00:43:14.070
This is a child...

00:43:15.720 --> 00:43:17.170
If it weren't for the wedding,

00:43:17.170 --> 00:43:19.150
she would have been sent as a hostage to the Khitans

00:43:21.930 --> 00:43:23.690
There was no other way

00:43:30.620 --> 00:43:32.880
Why didn't you tell me about this from the beginning?

00:43:35.060 --> 00:43:37.300
Then I wouldn't be so upset

00:43:38.200 --> 00:43:39.230
Also...

00:43:39.230 --> 00:43:41.130
Then I would have to ask you to be patient again

00:43:44.120 --> 00:43:46.290
I know you hate polygamy

00:43:47.500 --> 00:43:49.880
I tried my best to avoid marriage

00:43:51.740 --> 00:43:53.000
There was no other way

00:43:54.070 --> 00:43:56.030
And what should I have said?

00:44:04.900 --> 00:44:09.510
Yesterday... Jeong was in my chambers

00:44:11.040 --> 00:44:14.870
It seems he was practicing martial arts and forgot about the ban

00:44:15.940 --> 00:44:17.580
Nothing happened

00:44:21.510 --> 00:44:23.370
From now on don't lie to me

00:44:24.700 --> 00:44:29.670
No matter how bad and terrible things get, we both want to know the truth.

00:44:30.350 --> 00:44:32.280
What if it's something we don't want to talk about?

00:44:33.760 --> 00:44:35.360
What to do then?

00:44:38.660 --> 00:44:40.670
Just say you don't want to talk about it

00:44:41.680 --> 00:44:45.190
I hate people who lie

00:44:48.310 --> 00:44:49.700
That's what I'll do

00:44:56.600 --> 00:44:58.180
I won't lie anymore either

00:45:02.790 --> 00:45:06.930
So... you're not angry anymore?

00:45:14.360 --> 00:45:17.680
Do you regret getting married?

00:45:22.990 --> 00:45:24.180
No I don't regret it

00:45:25.190 --> 00:45:28.240
I had no choice to protect the emperor

00:45:29.910 --> 00:45:31.910
The princess was sent to the temple of Getes

00:45:32.810 --> 00:45:34.840
For now, before marriage,
we made this decision

00:45:39.010 --> 00:45:40.190
Before that...

00:45:43.900 --> 00:45:45.960
you said you loved someone

00:45:47.100 --> 00:45:48.140
This...

00:45:49.760 --> 00:45:50.790
Jeong?

00:45:52.840 --> 00:45:55.790
Not at all. No

00:45:59.110 --> 00:46:03.750
The day we went boating
you wanted to tell me something important

00:46:05.440 --> 00:46:08.300
You haven't really forgotten, have you?

00:46:13.820 --> 00:46:15.140
What is this?

00:46:30.990 --> 00:46:32.030
I...

00:46:35.960 --> 00:46:37.080
love you

00:46:37.840 --> 00:46:44.290
Because I'm next to you, I'm very happy

00:46:45.310 --> 00:46:51.910
Because I'm next to you, I keep dreaming

00:46:52.890 --> 00:47:00.530
Because I'm next to you, I smile so brightly

00:46:53.140 --> 00:46:56.900
In the future... don't forget these words

00:47:00.530 --> 00:47:06.410
For you to be mine, I always pray to the Gods

00:47:08.070 --> 00:47:14.710
I want to love you like my last love

00:47:15.600 --> 00:47:22.590
If only everything were like this, then life would be happy

00:47:23.120 --> 00:47:31.670
I will give my heart completely

00:47:31.670 --> 00:47:41.370
If you can stay with me for the rest of your life

00:47:45.770 --> 00:47:49.970
I'm with you

00:47:53.900 --> 00:47:58.670
All with you

00:48:59.750 --> 00:49:03.450
This... isn't a dream?

00:49:07.920 --> 00:49:09.080
All this time

00:49:10.990 --> 00:49:12.610
I was thinking about you

00:49:15.040 --> 00:49:17.120
I kept hoping

00:49:19.590 --> 00:49:21.990
that the wound you received from me has not yet healed

00:49:23.910 --> 00:49:25.040
It would be so

00:49:28.720 --> 00:49:30.390
you haven't forgotten me

00:49:43.450 --> 00:49:46.360
I couldn't come to you because I thought you'd be upset when you saw me.

00:50:11.690 --> 00:50:12.830
Brother

00:50:14.440 --> 00:50:15.790
What are you doing here, Vaughn?

00:50:16.550 --> 00:50:19.620
I brought a guest who really wants to see you

00:50:23.490 --> 00:50:24.500
Guest?

00:50:44.510 --> 00:50:48.210
Long time no see, Uk

00:50:51.000 --> 00:50:56.080
I heard that all this time you've been using Won to smuggle mercury into Damiwon Palace.

00:50:56.080 --> 00:51:00.290
Smart guys turned out to be scary people

00:51:01.700 --> 00:51:04.870
You see what a loyal person I am

00:51:04.870 --> 00:51:07.730
I couldn't help but notice my 3rd brother

00:51:10.790 --> 00:51:15.960
It seems you have something to discuss with me

00:51:15.960 --> 00:51:17.570
Of course

00:51:17.570 --> 00:51:19.710
And the night is not enough to talk

00:51:20.540 --> 00:51:21.940
I have so much to tell you

00:51:51.410 --> 00:51:52.680
Attack!

00:52:13.420 --> 00:52:15.590
Find the emperor. Fast!

00:52:15.590 --> 00:52:16.740
Eat!

00:52:20.670 --> 00:52:24.140
Jeong! Better kill me

00:52:24.140 --> 00:52:27.140
Get out of my way, I have to protect the emperor

00:52:27.140 --> 00:52:30.440
I can't watch my sons fight each other

00:52:30.840 --> 00:52:33.380
I don’t want to see my sons die before my eyes!

00:52:33.380 --> 00:52:35.120
Mother!

00:52:35.120 --> 00:52:38.720
Jeong... If your brother becomes emperor,

00:52:38.720 --> 00:52:41.390
everything will return to normal

00:52:41.390 --> 00:52:45.360
Then Goryeo will be safe, and so will we.

00:52:46.390 --> 00:52:49.000
Do you really want me to die?

00:52:50.530 --> 00:52:51.870
Where is the emperor?

00:52:51.870 --> 00:52:52.950
Do you want death?

00:52:52.950 --> 00:52:55.570
Search!

00:53:03.370 --> 00:53:05.880
Your Majesty! Your Majesty, what's wrong with you?

00:53:08.450 --> 00:53:11.110
Your Majesty, Your Majesty!
Are you okay?

00:53:11.110 --> 00:53:12.910
Your Majesty, what's wrong with you?

00:53:17.900 --> 00:53:20.760
Who are you? Get away from me! Let me in!

00:53:20.760 --> 00:53:22.560
Let me go! Your Majesty!

00:53:42.980 --> 00:53:44.220
I beg you, save me

00:54:14.360 --> 00:54:15.810
Your Majesty!

00:54:18.650 --> 00:54:19.910
Your Majesty!

00:54:21.670 --> 00:54:25.290
Something bad might happen.
Please get him out!

00:54:25.290 --> 00:54:26.650
Please

00:54:30.580 --> 00:54:33.130
Your Majesty. Your Majesty!

00:54:39.050 --> 00:54:43.410
Brother, you were meant to live
floundering, just like now

00:54:46.490 --> 00:54:48.800
If the deceased emperor knew,
that you will lead such a life,

00:54:49.510 --> 00:54:52.870
he would never choose you as emperor

00:54:53.630 --> 00:54:57.470
Your Majesty, come to your senses!
Your Majesty, Your Majesty!

00:55:02.020 --> 00:55:03.180
Your Majesty...

00:55:03.680 --> 00:55:06.060
Your Majesty. Your Majesty!

00:55:21.650 --> 00:55:24.420
It seems it's over

00:55:29.940 --> 00:55:31.390
I could lose once

00:55:33.240 --> 00:55:35.170
But I said I don't lose twice

00:56:09.030 --> 00:56:11.270
You!

00:56:22.990 --> 00:56:24.300
Stop!

00:56:47.300 --> 00:56:48.600
Your Majesty

00:56:51.110 --> 00:56:52.290
Your Majesty?

00:56:55.930 --> 00:56:57.150
Your Majesty

00:57:00.270 --> 00:57:01.370
Your Majesty?

00:57:05.900 --> 00:57:07.010
Mu?

00:57:10.110 --> 00:57:12.050
Mu, open your eyes

00:57:15.960 --> 00:57:17.070
Mu

00:57:24.760 --> 00:57:26.230
Mu!

00:57:39.470 --> 00:57:41.010
I didn't kill him

00:57:42.080 --> 00:57:45.140
He was already addicted to poison and was dying

00:57:48.070 --> 00:57:49.120
What?

00:57:49.870 --> 00:57:53.730
This girl, Hae Soo, put mercury
into the water of the imperial bath

00:57:59.290 --> 00:58:03.110
The Emperor took baths
prepared only by you

00:58:05.200 --> 00:58:07.670
There is mercury in the bath water

00:58:08.490 --> 00:58:09.920
How did this happen?

00:58:13.070 --> 00:58:16.510
I don't know anything about it

00:58:16.940 --> 00:58:19.040
You can choose one of two

00:58:19.890 --> 00:58:24.540
You can show your devotion
to our dead brother and die with the girl

00:58:26.140 --> 00:58:29.760
Or you can recognize me and save the girl

00:58:31.310 --> 00:58:36.210
Of course Hae Soo's crime is poisoning
Emperor will remain in force

00:58:37.260 --> 00:58:40.410
Whenever I need...

00:58:41.660 --> 00:58:44.210
I will accuse her of killing the emperor

00:58:54.740 --> 00:58:58.320
Let Hae Soo go. Now!

00:58:58.320 --> 00:59:03.370
Wolves are known for
that all their lives they love only one she-wolf

00:59:04.510 --> 00:59:06.610
After all, you're just an animal

00:59:07.770 --> 00:59:08.900
Out!

00:59:16.000 --> 00:59:17.170
Make a choice

00:59:18.060 --> 00:59:20.740
Hae Soo or

00:59:21.370 --> 00:59:22.690
dead emperor?

00:59:47.100 --> 00:59:54.200
Thanks for watching with us!
Release group MANIA

00:59:47.100 --> 00:59:54.200
http://doramamania.mybb.ru
http://vk.com/doramamania

00:59:54.200 --> 00:59:56.920
Scarlet Hearts: Ryeo

00:59:57.860 --> 01:00:01.270
Did you really kill your older brother?

01:00:01.270 --> 01:00:02.820
Congratulations, Your Majesty

01:00:02.820 --> 01:00:06.150
To carry out Wang Gu's rebellion,
we have to catch Eun

01:00:06.150 --> 01:00:08.850
Don't you have a dog you can use?

01:00:08.560 --> 01:00:14.860
You may suddenly pass by and not notice, have you forgotten me?

01:00:09.200 --> 01:00:09.900
Catch 'em

01:00:09.900 --> 01:00:11.340
I won't do it

01:00:11.340 --> 01:00:13.640
You must

01:00:14.860 --> 01:00:21.860
But until you remember me, I will wait for you

01:00:15.000 --> 01:00:18.590
Court lady Hae Soo hides Eun and his wife in Damiwon

01:00:18.590 --> 01:00:21.280
Run! I'll stop them, and you run!

01:00:21.910 --> 01:00:23.810
Please let us go!

01:00:22.160 --> 01:00:26.670
At the same time, in the same place we will be...

01:00:23.810 --> 01:00:25.030
Doc!
